{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他没再等一个不会伤到任何东西的办法，接着做眼前的事，久违的劲头又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"久违的劲头\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他尽力做好眼前能做的事，也不再逼自己非得把一切扭转过来。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽力做好\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种不必防备的生活，也知道眼前的事得做，怕顾住一头会伤到另一头。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"正因为舍不得自己真心爱惜的生活，他愿意把眼前的事担起来。\",\n      \"key\": \"担起来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，想到眼前的事可能伤到那种生活，担心又冒出来，他仍带着不安继续做。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着不安继续做\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再等待无损办法、重新行动和久违的劲头；把不靠否认脆弱维持决心，落实为明知还会累、仍带着不安继续做。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留尽力行动却不要求改变一切的意思，写成他实际怎样做，也保留努力有其限度这一认识。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确他舍不得的是不必防备的生活，也知道眼前有事要做；保留怕顾住一头会伤到另一头的真实为难。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"补回盲评反复指出的责任内容。明确写出他愿意为真心爱惜的生活承担眼前的事，舍不得本身就是行动的理由，而不是行动的拖累。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\", \"S12-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把决心比过去踏实的原因落在他愿为珍爱之物承担上；把不必等犹疑消失落在带着不安继续做。删去与 R60 重复的原则总结，同时保留上一轮 S12-4 的局部担心、短暂动摇和继续向前，顺延为 S12-5。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8528265e-6a99-4930-b4f4-049e5922ff51", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002415814455Z", "elapsed_seconds": 204.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:27:40.457686+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7d2838f62a2299236951bceb69bb85ff1d71ef2f0758665209152f5425cd1f5e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_r